WEBVTT

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.630
I gave power to the humans...

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.040
Who stole the Numbers...

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.740
I was intending to destroy the Astral Wold that way...

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.460
But Tron and Faker have lost to ZeXal.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:23.480
What are you panning to do now?

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.500
Can we still afford to remain mere spectators, Durbe?

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.720
This time, we shall act ourselves.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:35.130
But both the Astral World and 
the Barian World are worlds of high energies.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.440
They cannot interfere directly with each other.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:41.160
It is because of that reason that we used the humans, right?

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:45.480
And besides, we can't be in that world in our original forms.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.360
We can't collect the Numbers directly.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.150
But we have to do it regardless.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.650
Because we need the Numbers.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:55.700
Up we go.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:56.860
Alit!

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:00.410
I'd rather not waste our time like Vector did.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.210
Gilag, you go.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:07.260
Me?

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:10.570
You are the brave warrior of Barian.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.210
I am sure you can do this.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.170
Nothing to be done then.

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:23.880
I'll help myself to all the Numbers and snatch them up all at once!

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:30.690
I'm counting on you, Gilag.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:47.040
<i>He who opens this door shall obtain a new power.</i>

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.370
<i>However, as the price for this power...</i>

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:52.590
<i>...you shall lose that which is most important to you.</i>

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:55.550
That which is... most important to me?

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:59.430
<i>Yes. That which is most important to you,</i>

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.010
<i>You will lose it sooner or later.</i>

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:03.720
That which is most important to me...?

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:13.770
That hurt...

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.090
Huh?

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:23.440
Geez... You <i>really</i> are such an idiot.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:25.270
Couldn't be helped.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.360
Of course it could be helped!

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:29.830
<i>You're</i> the one who always falls asleep in class.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.000
Well, school is finished, so it's Duel time...

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:34.910
Huh?

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.980
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, you're so cute!

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:42.930
You're the Champion of the W.D.C.!

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:48.190
Wow, Yuma's crazy popular, or not.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.560
It must be a sign that the world is coming to an end...

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.360
Gosh, fawning over Yuma like that...

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:55.650
Rats...! I'll neow-ver forgive them!

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.190
Right, I got it.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.930
You're all lining up for my autograph!

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:05.280
And the Duel Carnival Champion, good ol' Yuma Tsukumo-<i>chan</i>, won't run away!

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.580
Hey, can you get me an autograph from Shark-<i>sama</i>?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.040
Kaito-<i>sama</i> for me, too!

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:10.750
Me too!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.710
IV-<i>sama</i> for me!

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.210
Can you pass on this fan letter?

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.630
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:28.600
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.310
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.660
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.740
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:51.250
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.620
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.840
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:01.380
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.510
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.220
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.680
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.730
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.190
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:20.230
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:22.990
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.450
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:29.160
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:38.210
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:58.110
<i>"Number 74: Barian Strikes!
 The Shocking Chaos Xyz Change!"</i>

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:58.360
We collected a total of 50 Numbers during the Duel Carnival.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:07.200
Are those Numbers trying to guide me to something?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:14.910
This is...!

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:18.330
Drat.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:22.460
It was <i>me</i> who won the Duel Carnival, and yet those guys...!

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:26.050
Oh, <i>really</i>? You seemed like you were <i>enjoying</i> yourself to <i>me</i>.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.430
That's not what it's about!

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:31.060
On top of that, Tetsuo and
 the others had to go and leave so quickly!

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:34.430
Thanks to that, I didn't even Duel today.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:40.570
Actually, Tetsuo-<i>kun</i> and the guys
were up for secret special training.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:41.440
Special training?

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:42.230
Yep!

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:46.070
Nobody wants to lose to you, Yuma, so they stayed after school.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.450
What's with those guys?!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.910
Not telling me about it!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.910
Isn't it okay once in a while?

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.120
Huh? Speaking of which, where's Astral?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.790
I haven't seen him today.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:02.170
He's been hiding in the key lately.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.130
Well, at least he's not bugging me...

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:06.340
Hmm?

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:10.930
Shark!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.890
Hey, Shark!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:15.850
Shark!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.560
Is your injury better now?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:19.650
Yes.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.360
Where are you going? Hey, wanna have a Duel?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.490
Sorry, but I'm going to see my younger sister right now.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.910
Your sister...? So you're going to the hospital?

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.790
The Duel Carnival is over.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.040
But she's still...

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.540
Shark...

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.680
<i>We have breaking news.</i>

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:59.020
<i>Just now, an incident has occurred in the suburbs of Heartland City, where a cash transport has been robbed.</i>

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:05.070
<i>According to our information, the criminals are a group of masked...</i>

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.440
With this I will gain huge power.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.990
Much more power than anyone else.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:11.490
Huh?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:27.800
This is...!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.220
What's happening, Orbital?!

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:33.760
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:38.020
There is an abnormality of gravitational waves in Bay Area 3013!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.810
What...? Don't tell me...

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.690
What...What's happening?

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:46.400
That feeling right now... What... on earth?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:50.490
Shark!

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.280
What the...?

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.540
What the hell <i>was</i> that?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:12.010
So this is the world this Yuma Tsukumo lives in, is it?

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.390
Who the hell... are you?

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.010
What a filthy place I fell into.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.100
The air quality sucks and there's garbage all over the place.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:24.310
Well, it <i>is</i> the perfect home for a bunch of <i>worms</i>.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.400
You dare look down on us!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.070
We'll kick your ass!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.110
What?!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.370
Where did he go?

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.160
Over here! Here!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.580
What the hell just happened?

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.890
How... How's that?

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.850
What lovely eyes you have.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.100
That's how I like them.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.820
Guys like you with the eyes of a small, frightened animal.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.360
You guys want power, right?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.540
Then I will give power to you!

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.620
We ain't talking <i>smalltime</i> power here, either!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.830
It's a much <i>bigger</i> power!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.750
Now, work for the Barian World!

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.130
For the Barian World!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:41.890
Barian... Barian... Barian... Barian!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:49.110
<i>The Numbers seem to be trying to tell me something.</i>

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.900
<i>Different from the memories I've had up until now.</i>

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:56.490
<i>Yes, they must be very important memories.</i>

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.490
Okay, here it comes!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:01.620
I...!

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.000
Rio!

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:13.670
Rio!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.720
30 minutes ago, her condition suddenly got worse.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.970
You. Get the ICU ready.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:22.970
Yes.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:27.350
Rio...

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:33.110
... coming...

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:36.780
...coming!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.030
The disaster... is coming!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:41.490
Disaster?

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:46.700
They're coming! They're coming to take away that which is precious to you!

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:50.750
They...?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.090
That which is precious...?

00:10:55.210 --> 00:11:00.340
<i>He who opens this door shall obtain a new power.</i>

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.800
<i>However, as the price for this power...</i>

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.720
<i>...you shall lose that which is most important to you.</i>

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.850
<i>That which is most important to me...</i>

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:11.310
<i>My...</i>

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.190
<i>Astral!</i>

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:20.490
Don't tell me... It's you...?

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:27.450
It's from Tetsuo.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.500
<i>Are you Yuma Tsukumo?</i>

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.540
Who the heck are you?!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.340
<i>Yuma!</i>

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:37.460
Tetsuo!

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:41.180
<i>Yuma! Don't come here! Got it, don't come here...!</i>

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.300
Tetsuo?! Tetsuo!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.350
I will rob everything from you.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:49.770
Come to school right now!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.600
Along with your Numbers.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:52.850
Numbers?!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:57.690
<i>Your friends will suffer even more pain if you don't come.</i>

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:05.450
What is it? What on Earth is happening? Yuma!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:06.910
Numbers...

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.660
So they really are after Astral...

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:10.830
Astral?!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.830
I don't know, but...

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.790
Someone is trying to steal Astral away.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:16.630
Eh?

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.550
Kotori, can you keep this for me?

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:25.550
But if Astral isn't there, then Hope...!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:28.560
I won't give Astral to anyone.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:31.270
I'm the only one who can protect him.

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:35.940
Yuma!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.860
Wait! I'll come too!

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:42.150
Rio.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:46.820
Yuma...

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:49.700
What?!

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:53.410
This is...

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.710
What is going on?!

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.380
<i>Astral, there's no way I'd let someone take you!</i>

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.840
<i>I'll protect you for sure!</i>

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.060
Guys!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.110
Hey, are you guys okay?! Hey!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:26.660
I'm so sorry. We've been trying our best for you, Yuma...

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.120
He's just too strong...

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.950
Yuma, I told you not to come.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.700
How can I leave you guys alone?!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.040
So you came, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.670
Now, you'll give me all of your Numbers!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.010
Who are you? Why do you want the Numbers?

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:52.640
I have been given great power by Barian.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:54.730
Barian?!

00:13:55.390 --> 00:14:00.060
I will turn you into the foundation stone for the Barian World, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:03.820
Why? Wasn't he defeated back then...?

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.030
That fight was just the prologue.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:13.330
The curtain has already been dropped on the new stage.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:16.330
As you wish, Barian! I accept your challenge!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.040
Duel Disk, set!

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.970
D-Gazer, set!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.470
<i>AR Vision: Link established.</i>

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.220
Duel!!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:40.100
The Emperor's Key has closed. What in the world is...?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.530
And this feeling... A Duel seems to have started.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.190
Yuma...

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.570
Cat it to 'im, Yuma!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:56.410
Now, here I come. My turn! Draw!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.830
I Summon Devil Motor!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:08.920
Then I activate the Magic Card, Dark Engineering!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:13.800
With this card, if there is a Level Three Machine Monster on my field,

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:17.600
I can Special Summon one Monster with the same name from my hand.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:20.850
One more Devil Motor appears!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:27.030
Two Level Three Monsters! Is he gonna do it?!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:31.110
I Overlay the two Level Three Devil Motors!

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.490
I build the Overlay Network with these two Monsters!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.120
Xyz Summon!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.920
Appear, Machine-Armored Angel, Enginel!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.420
He already Xyz Summoned one in his first turn?!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:52.590
But it's got 1800 Attack Points. If that's the case...

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.430
It's too early to relax.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:16:01.230
I activate the effects of the Devil Motors
that have become Overlay Units!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:06.730
When they become Overlay Units, each
inflicts 400 points of damage to my opponent!

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.110
Wha... what?!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.440
There are two Devil Motors!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.200
Take 800 points of damage!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.880
With this, I end my turn.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.550
Yuma Tsukumo, it's useless to struggle.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:38.060
You are absolutely powerless in front of the power of Barian.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Hope... If I could just use Hope...</i>

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.320
<i>No... In this Duel, I have to rely on my own power.</i>

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:52.440
<i>Astral... He's always been helping me.</i>

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.200
<i>So this time, no matter what happens to me...</i>

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.030
<i>It's my turn to protect him.</i>

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:00.370
Here I go!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.540
My turn!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.000
Draw!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.210
Yuma is having a Duel with the Numbers at stake!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:11.710
Hope?!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.680
Do you want to go to Yuma...?

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.020
<i>So you came, Hope!</i>

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.900
I Summon Goblindbergh!

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:32.530
When this Monster is Summoned,

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:36.320
I can Special Summon one Level Four or lower Monster from my hand!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.490
I'm calling out this guy!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.410
Appear, Bachibachibachi!

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:49.460
Then, I activate the Magic Card, Plus Star 123!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:55.760
This card can add levels from 1 to 3 to a Level Four or lower Monster.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:18:00.050
I increase Bachibachibachi's level from three to four.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:05.560
I Overlay my Level Four Goblindbergh and Bachibachibachi!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:10.610
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.610
Xyz Summon!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:17.490
Appear, Number 39!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.160
Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.790
So you are there, Aspiring Emperor - Hope.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:32.000
Go, Hope! Attack Enginel!

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:37.340
I activate Enginel's effect!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:40.090
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:44.010
this card is switched to Defense Position and it cannot be destroyed by battle!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.100
Bachibachibachi's effect activates!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:53.110
When an Xyz Monster who has this card as its Overlay Unit attacks a Monster in Defense Position,

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:58.820
if the Attack Power exceeds its Defense Power, then the difference will be inflicted to my opponent as damage!

00:18:59.150 --> 00:18:59.910
What?!

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.240
Go, Hope!

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:04.580
Hope Sword Bachibachibachi Slash!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.920
Good job! Yuma! Keep it up!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:16.210
Do your best, Yuma!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.680
Yuma Tsukumo... He is quite good indeed.

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.260
But Astral isn't there.

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:24.890
What is going on?

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.520
With this, I end my turn!

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.310
How's that? Did you realize Hope's pow... ?

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.520
Wh-What's so funny?

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.440
I've been waiting for this.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:36.980
Huh?

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:40.490
I've been waiting for your Hope!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.410
My turn!

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:43.620
Draw!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.290
Have a good look, <i>this</i> is Barian's power!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:53.580
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force, from my hand!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:55.880
Barian's Force?!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.130
This is where it gets worth watching.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:03.340
This card can Rank-Up my Xyz Monster,

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:06.050
and Special Summon a Chaos Xyz Monster!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:12.230
I rebuild the Overlay Network with the Rank Three Enginel!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:17.150
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.240
The power of Barian born inside Chaos...

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:25.700
Cast your judgment on this filthy world!

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:44.890
Chaos Xyz: Machine-Armored Djinn, Engeneral!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.470
Chaos Xyz!

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:48.180
What's with that Monster?!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.850
That Xyz Monster's Rank was upgraded?!

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.060
I've never seen that before, or not!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:56.350
This is the power of Barian that will send you to Hell.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:58.110
Take a good look!

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.860
I activate the effect of Barian's Force!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:04.780
When a Chaos Xyz was Special Summoned with Barian's Force,

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:09.830
it can absorb all Overlay Units
from an Xyz Monster my opponent controls!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:10.700
What?!

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.080
Chaos Drain!

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.460
Hope's Overlay Units...

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.720
...were all been absorbed!

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.800
Now I can't use Hope's effect!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:28.140
I'm not done!

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:31.470
The monster who got its Overlay Units taken away

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:35.060
will lose 300 Attack Points for each Overlay Unit it loses!

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:38.060
Thus, it loses 600 points!

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.190
Hope!

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:46.820
Before the Chaos Xyz with Barian's Force, your Monster is completely powerless!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:51.830
Yuma...

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:56.870
Yuma.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.750
It's over, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:06.680
I will take away all of your Numbers!

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:24.190
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:31.870
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:39.460
<i>Do you laugh at my "impossible" dream?</i>

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:46.800
<i>I must be pretty laughable for not being able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.340 --> 00:23:03.730
<i>The song that supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:08.530
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:18.870
<i>As long as I live, I will always be your little friend</i>

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:27.420
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:32.220
<i>I will become the artist</i>

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:38.520
<i>Just do what you want</i>
